      "content": "I understand that you're feeling trapped, but it's not about settling for a life that feels hollow. It's about finding your own version of greatness, even if it's not what society typically expects. You don't have to matter to everyone, just to yourself. And if you're not satisfied with your current situation, maybe it's time to explore new paths and opportunities. There's always a chance for something better, even if it's not immediately apparent. Don't give up on yourself just yet.",
      "source": "target",
